WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Illustrated demo using fictional data. Search and preview run with askmywa v0.1.0; no WhatsApp account is linked and nothing is sent.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.200
The tool searches the local archive and finds two messages containing “elevator”. The question is an example prompt.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:18.800
Authors, times and text come from actual tool results, using this fictional archive dated 16 November 2026.

4
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:26.400
This summary was written for the video from the returned messages. The sources remain visible so you can check it.

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:34.000
The server identifies Sophie and returns this preview. The result says “not sent” and “confirmation needed”.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.600
Your assistant is instructed to ask for approval before confirming a send. askmywa has no independent approval window. This demo stops at the preview.

7
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:48.200
The archive is local. In real use, retrieved messages reach your AI provider. The history supplied by WhatsApp may be incomplete.

8
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:53.200
Free and open source. Claude Desktop on Mac or Windows; ChatGPT on Mac and Codex via the Terminal installer. Instructions at askmywa.com.

